        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You specialize in throwing highly explosive portable ordnances. You become trained with grenades. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.Quick Toss] action.</p>\n<p>At 5th level, your proficiency rank with grenades increases to expert, and you gain access to the critical specialization effects of all grenades.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> If you have the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.feats.Item.Soldier Dedication] feat, you can take this feat even if you haven't taken two additional soldier archetype feats. Soldier archetype feats count as grenadier archetype feats, and vice-versa, for purposes of completing the archetypes.</p>"
